<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s358S">[iv.301-11a] ,gsum pa ni, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w1">phra ma</span> ni <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s358f1">bsams bzhin du</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s358p1">ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w2">nor</span> bar <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w3">pha rol po</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w4">mdza&#x27; ba</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w5">dbye ba</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s358p2">phyir</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w6">nyon mongs pa can</span> gyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w7">sems</span> kyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w8">tshig</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w9">don</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s358f2">pha rol pos</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w10">go ba</span>&#x27;o</span>
