<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s358S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w1">Divisive speech</span> consists of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w8">words</span> which are spoken <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s358f1">purposely</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s358p1">without</span> any <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w2">mistake</span>, and in a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w6">mentally afflicted</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w7">state</span>; they are <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s358p2">meant to</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w5">split up</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w3">others</span> who are <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w4">friends</span>, and their <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w9">meaning</span> should be <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s358w10">understood</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s358f2">by the other person</span>.</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Codex independent TIBETAN-FIRST PROVISIONAL proposal. Keep purposeful intent separate from the without-mistake condition. First others are the friends being divided; the complete later agentive phrase identifies the hearer. Mentally afflicted and explicit state have separate source heads. Shared passive/definition grammar stays unbanked. Source origin f614639348a03fa30cc53db1b27c6b2034df43cb through354; actual through357 acceptance is a separately supplied later checkpoint, never invented.</div>
